# 跨平台一致性：默认对文本自动识别，并统一用 LF 换行，避免 Windows/macOS 混用导致的 diff 噪声
* text=auto eol=lf

# 文本类：显式强制 LF，保证脚本/文档/配置在各平台落地换行一致
*.py    text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf

# 二进制类：禁止换行/编码转换与 diff，避免文件被 Git 破坏
*.docx  binary
*.doc   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.xlsx  binary
